meta {
  name: Plans
  seq: 8
}

docs {
  Four-tier plan matrix: **free**, **paper**, **pro**, **pro_plus**.

  | Plan | Paper accts | Paper WH | Live WH | Live brokers | Paper trades/mo |
  |------|-------------|----------|---------|--------------|-----------------|
  | free | 1 | 1 | 0 | 0 | 10 |
  | paper | 3 | 5 | 0 | 0 | unlimited |
  | pro | 5 | 8 | 1 | 1 | unlimited |
  | pro_plus | 10 | 15 | 5 | 3 | unlimited |

  **Pro Plus only:** multi-product Indian broker credentials (`products: ["MIS","CNC","NRML"]`).

  **Testing flow**
  1. Admin → PUT Set User Plan (pick tier)
  2. Plans → GET Me — *-limits (assert caps)
  3. Billing → GET Billing Plans (catalog includes `multi_product_credentials` on pro_plus)

  Reference: repo `internal/plan/plan.go` and dashboard Billing page.
}
